 village. That humiliation lies concealed under a myth of cowboy bluster and feminine frailty, which is reanimated whenever threat and shame looms.--From publisher description.","primaryTopic":"Literature & Writers","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"Society & Culture","confidence":"high","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"Society & Culture","score":8,"evidenceCount":1}],"evidence":[{"source":"llm_classifier","rawLabel":"Society & Culture","mappedSubject":"Society & Culture","score":8,"confidence":"high","note":"The book examines America's psychological and cultural response to the September 11 attacks, focusing on societal values and the interplay of politics and historical context.","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi-1"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Popular culture","mappedSubject":"Arts & Criticism","score":5,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi-8"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Mass media","mappedSubject":"Journalism & Reportage","score":5,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi-6"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Politics and government","mappedSubject":"Politics & Government","score":5,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi-4"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Political culture","mappedSubject":"Society & Culture","score":5,"confidence":"high","sourceId":"source-open-library-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi","id":"subject-evidence-book-the-terror-dream-susan-faludi-5"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","rawLabel":"Popular culture","mappedSubject":"S